परिखायाढञ् — The affix ढञ् (+एय) comes after परिखा (moat) in the senses of "sufficient for that" and "sufficient therein." This debars छ.

पारिखेयी भूमिः — "land sufficient to make a moat thereon"

@note[Up to this sūtra was the governing force of छ and यत्. From the next sūtra onward, another affix will be taught.]
